---
description: User-local preferences for the Lukka plugin. Copy this file to preferences.local.md and customize.
---

# Lukka Plugin Preferences

## Default pair format
Preferred counter currency for price lookups (default: USD).
Counter: USD

## Default AML depth
Which AML report to run by default: scoring (light), standard (full), enhanced (deep).
AML depth: scoring

## Briefing assets
Number of top assets to show in /briefing (default: 20, max: 50).
Top N: 20

## News preferences
Default news lookback window in days.
News days: 7

## Output format
Preferred output format for data tables: table, json, csv.
Format: table
